          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee epuo ninche aaing'uaa ninye, neing'uaaa ninye eeta olbae sapuk, neiguanare isinkan lenyena ninye pee ear metua, aaitalaku osarge lo layioni le Yehoida ilo apolosani, near ninche ninye metua te nchumata endapash enye. Neye ninye; nenukaa ninche ninye te nkanasa e Daudi, kake eitu ninche enukaa ninye too nkuraren oo laiguanak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
